giRNDsub ftgen 108, 0, 128, -2, 699.0, 350.0, 233.0, 175.0, 140.0, 117.0, 99.9, 87.4, 77.7, 69.9, 63.6, 58.3, 53.8, 49.9, 46.6, 43.7, 41.1, 38.8, 36.8, 35.0, 33.3, 31.8, 30.4, 29.1, 28.0, 26.9, 25.9, 25.0, 24.1, 23.3, 22.6, 21.8, 21.2, 20.6, 20.0, 19.4, 18.9, 18.4, 17.9, 17.5, 17.1, 16.6, 16.3, 15.9, 15.5, 15.2, 14.9, 14.6, 14.3, 14.0, 13.7, 13.4, 13.2, 12.9, 12.7, 12.5, 12.3, 12.1, 11.8, 11.7, 11.5, 11.3, 11.1, 10.9, 10.8, 10.6, 10.4, 10.3, 10.1, 9.99, 9.85, 9.71, 9.58, 9.45, 9.32, 9.2, 9.08, 8.96, 8.85, 8.74, 8.63, 8.53, 8.42, 8.32, 8.22, 8.13, 8.04, 7.94, 7.85, 7.77, 7.68, 7.6, 7.52, 7.44, 7.36, 7.28, 7.21, 7.13, 7.06, 6.99, 6.92, 6.85, 6.79, 6.72, 6.66, 6.59, 6.53, 6.47, 6.41, 6.36, 6.3, 6.24, 6.19, 6.13, 6.08, 6.03, 5.97, 5.92, 5.87, 5.83, 5.78, 5.73, 5.68, 5.64, 5.59, 5.55, 5.5, 5.46
